Description: Linux network supervision and administration TUI
 NETWATCH NG is a lightweight terminal user interface for discovering
 and identifying devices, inspecting the local gateway and Wi-Fi
 environment, and managing NETWATCH-owned firewall and traffic rules.
 .
 The application uses optional system tools when available and reports
 unavailable capabilities explicitly. Privileged network changes require
 root privileges.
